{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:47 2026-10-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:47 2026-10-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:47 2026-10-27 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7737b515855c38a9eb725ae00908e48/2026-10/459d6213-56c9-43b8-9a4f-6442d432a608_5.jpg\"/><p>葵涌道1013-1033號昌年大廈對開，今（27日）早上9時11分，一部輕貨、一部中型貨車及一部小巴發生相撞意外，事件中初步有6女3男受傷，救援人員正在場處理傷者傷勢。</p><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，葵涌道(往九龍方向)近昌榮路迴旋處的部份行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。現時上址交通繁忙。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:00:38.392428+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T01:47:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:58:25.967072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T01:58:25.967072+00:00","content_hash":"b43ab1936cd56f8290aa2927eec95f83e06ad6e997533f5295bac7ded0244731","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}